Z||000019||Adrift||11-28-2001||12:22 AM||||I took the carpets out to dye them, and used two coats... the spray on-type dye will rub out if you rub it hard, so thats why I bought the floor mats, Looks great... will post more pics later||||reg||1
Z||000020||Krashdavus||11-28-2001||11:41 AM||||Bad news for those of you that have the Grey Salt and Pepper.  A1 Auto Carpets does not have this colour, nor will they in the Future.  Neither does The Fiero Store or ACC. So the alternative is to buy a grey replacement and then buy and extra yard to do the doors.  Nuff said on this one.||||reg||1
